            <p>Collaborative Construction was founded by Wesleigh Behn, a Massachusetts native with over 30 years of experience in both residential and commercial construction. Wesleigh holds a Bachelor's degree from Boston University and completed postgraduate studies at the Boston Architectural Center.</p>
